WEBVTT

00:09:57.415 --> 00:10:00.253
And as we were walking along
this narrow strip of road,

00:10:00.277 --> 00:10:03.789
a few of the trucks reared by us so close,

00:10:04.619 --> 00:10:08.488
and out of their tailpipe
was the specter of mob violence.

00:10:08.512 --> 00:10:09.878
It was unnerving.

00:10:11.232 --> 00:10:12.541
But then it happened.

00:10:13.280 --> 00:10:15.777
Right on the border
of Maryland and Delaware,

00:10:16.840 --> 00:10:18.712
we saw a man standing by his truck.

00:10:18.736 --> 00:10:20.175
The tailgate was down.

00:10:20.199 --> 00:10:22.016
He had on a brown jacket.

00:10:22.040 --> 00:10:23.583
He was standing there awkwardly.

00:10:23.607 --> 00:10:26.071
The first two girls in our group,
Jewel and Sandria,

00:10:26.095 --> 00:10:28.300
they walked by because
he looked suspicious.

00:10:28.324 --> 00:10:29.331
(Laughter)

00:10:29.355 --> 00:10:32.008
But the bigger group, we stopped
to give him a chance.